# Smoke test "Xstore is running": succeeds only when the real login screen is ready.
# It never logs in and never starts a sale.
# Run with: config/localhost-shell.json (opts in to the trusted localhost HTTPS certificate).
1. Open app at "/xstoreshellapp/"
2. Use Xstore shell configuration from "shell-configuration.json" if prompted
3. Dismiss the device error prompt if shown
4. Wait for the Xstore login screen
